                  "text": "Yna 20:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Omwowokwa nyoman lö kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo orötokwa ngwïny, keröto yïm akï kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo otyokokwa ngwïny, ketyoko yïm.",
          "type": "text",
